-- The use cases come in shown, with "MIRA adoption map" as their author, and get their version 1.


Federated vs centralized:
- Ideally, users control a personal view of their knowledge units (claim URLs point to personal views).
- Personal views link to a global view; there could be several global views, as long as they are based on the same global data.
- There should be a way to act on the union of all personal storage for aggregate metrics.
- Possibility of organization subviews.', 'New with MIRA', 'Authors, readers and toolmakers should see a benefit to connecting to the MIRA commons, especially in terms of metrics and discovery.');







